  "description": "Serve up only the best! On graduation day, U-Jeong confesses his affection for fellow classmate Yeong-Ung. His big news is rejected, however, and they move on to high school. Now U-Jeong is a newbie member of the ping pong club... But in a twist of fate he faces Yeong-Ung again, already an ace player. Can brokenhearted U-Jeong overcome his feelings and go for the win despite the bullies that stand in his way? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
